SchemeService ..> SchemeCardRenderer
SchemeService ..> SealService
SchemeService ..> WardrobeService
SocialController --> SocialService
SocialService --> CounterStorePort
SocialService --> EV
SocialService --> REPO_MySQL
SocialService ..> MediaService
SocialService ..> NotificationService
SocialService ..> SchemeService
WardrobeController --> WardrobeService
WardrobeService --> AI
WardrobeService --> EV
WardrobeService --> JobQueuePort
